<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A3" title="In HypoSpace: Evaluating LLM Creativity as Set-Valued Hypothesis Generators under Underdetermination" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">C </span>Model Metadata and Prompts</span></a></li>
</ol></nav>
